@startuml
skinparam roundcorner 8

node "Conteneurisation Locale (Docker Compose)" {
    node "Service Frontend (Node 24-alpine)" {
        component "Next.js Web Server\n(Port 3000)" as LocalFront
    }
    node "Service Backend (Python 3.13-slim)" {
        component "FastAPI / Uvicorn\n(Port 8000)" as LocalBack
    }
}

cloud "Configuration Déploiement Cloud (Non vérifié en runtime)" {
    node "Vercel Edge Network" {
        component "Next.js SSR Frontend" as CloudFront
    }
    node "Railway Cloud Platform" {
        component "FastAPI Production Container" as CloudBack
    }
    database "MongoDB Atlas" {
        folder "ai_market_intelligence Cluster" as CloudDB
    }
}

LocalFront ..> LocalBack : HTTP REST & WS (http://localhost:8000)
CloudFront ..> CloudBack : HTTPS REST & WSS (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL)
LocalBack ..> CloudDB : Motor Async Driver (MONGODB_URI)
CloudBack ..> CloudDB : Motor Async Driver (MONGODB_URI)

note bottom of CloudBack
Configuration présente dans le dépôt :
- railway.toml
- Dockerfile.railway
- DEPLOYMENT.md
(Déploiement cloud non vérifié dans le présent audit local)
end note

@enduml

